<%- include('partials/header') %><section class="prose"><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT SECURITY</span><h1>Email and sign-in protection</h1><div class="panel"><h2>Contact email</h2><p><%= user.email %> — <strong><%= user.emailVerifiedAt?'Verified':'Not verified' %></strong></p><p>Phone number ownership is not verified by Nestly. Property document review is a separate process.</p><% if(!emailReady){ %><div class="notice">The administrator has not configured email delivery. Verification and password recovery are unavailable; no emails are being sent.</div><% }else if(!user.emailVerifiedAt){ %><form method="post" action="/account/verify/send"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="outline">Send verification link</button></form><% } if(delivery){ %><p>Latest provider email status: <%= delivery.status %> · <%= date(delivery.updatedAt) %>. Provider delivery status does not verify address ownership.</p><% } %></div><div class="panel"><h2>Google sign-in</h2><% if(user.googleSubject){ %><p><strong>Google connected</strong></p><p>You can sign in with your Google account. Your Nestly role and administrator MFA requirements stay the same.</p><% }else{ %><p>Connect the Google account with the same email as your Nestly account. Confirm your current password first.</p><% if(!googleReady){ %><p class="notice">Google sign-in is not configured yet.</p><% } %><form method="post" action="/account/google/connect"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Current Nestly password<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="128"></label><button class="google-signin" <%= googleReady?'':'disabled' %>>Connect Google</button></form><% } %></div><% if(user.role==='admin'){ %><div class="panel"><h2>Administrator MFA</h2><p><%= user.mfa?.enabled?'Enabled. New sign-ins require an authenticator or unused recovery code.':'Required before production administration. Use a TOTP authenticator.' %></p><% if(setup){ %><p>Add this setup key manually to your authenticator, account: <%= user.email %>, issuer Nestly, 6 digits, 30 seconds.</p><p class="preserve"><code><%= setup.secret %></code></p><form method="post" action="/account/mfa/confirm"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Six-digit code<input name="code" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" autocomplete="one-time-code" required></label><button class="button">Confirm MFA</button></form><% }else if(!user.mfa?.enabled){ %><form method="post" action="/account/mfa/setup"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Current password<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><button class="outline">Set up authenticator</button></form><% } if(recoveryCodes){ %><div class="notice"><h3>Save your recovery codes now</h3><p>Each works once. These codes will not be shown again. Keep them securely away from your password.</p><ul><% for(const code of recoveryCodes){ %><li><code><%= code %></code></li><% } %></ul></div><% } %><p>If you lose both your authenticator and recovery codes, the hosting administrator must follow the documented identity-checked recovery procedure.</p></div><% } %></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
